---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - ipofins" description="ipofins privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <section class="container-narrow py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 2026</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>ipofins is a static website. We do not collect personal information, require registration, or store user data on our servers. The calculators run entirely in your browser.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Cookies & Analytics</h2>
      <p>We may use privacy-focused analytics (such as Plausible or Google Analytics) to understand traffic patterns. We use localStorage for theme preferences only (dark/light mode). No personal data is stored.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We may display ads via Google AdSense and use affiliate links for broker partnerships. These third parties may use cookies per their own privacy policies. We do not share personal data with these parties.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related queries, contact us at privacy@ipofins.com</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
